    "bodyRequired": false,
    "description": "<hr>\n<h3>Parameters</h3>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li> <code>page</code>: page number needed if data size > 200 </li>\n<li> <code>page_size</code>: size of the page </li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n\n\n<hr>\n<h3>Example</h3>\n<hr>\n\n- <code>id</code>                   : 1\n- <code>product_id</code>                         : 1\n- <code>product_name</code> : Apple\n- <code>product_base_unit_name</code>            : Pcs\n- <code>unit_id</code>                          : 1\n- <code>unit_name</code>               : Box\n- <code>rate</code> : 20\n- <code>buy_price_per_unit</code>                          : 10000\n- <code>buy_price_per_unit_currency_format</code>                          : Rp.  10.000,00\n- <code>sell_price_per_unit</code>                          : 20000\n- <code>sell_price_per_unit_currency_format</code>                          : Rp.  20.000,00\n\n1 Box Of Apple = 20 Pcs Apple\n\nBuy price for 1 Box of Apple = 10000\n\nSell price for 1 Box of Apple = 20000\n\n<hr>\n<h3>Value Description</h3>\n<hr>\n\n- <code>id</code>                   : unit conversion id\n- <code>product_id</code>                         : product id in current unit conversion\n- <code>product_name</code> : product name in current unit conversion\n- <code>product_base_unit_id</code>            : base unit id used in current unit conversion\n- <code>product_base_unit_name</code> : base unit name used in current unit conversion\n- <code>unit_id</code>                          : converted unit id\n- <code>unit_name</code>               : converted unit name\n- <code>rate</code> : rate value of current unit conversion\n- <code>buy_price_per_unit</code>                          : buy price per unit for current unit conversion\n- <code>buy_price_per_unit_currency_format</code>                          : buy price per unit in currency format\n- <code>sell_price_per_unit</code>                          : sell price per unit for current unit conversion\n- <code>sell_price_per_unit_currency_format</code>                          : sell price per unit in currency format",
