    "bodyRequired": false,
    "description": "<hr/>\n<h3>Parameters</h3>\n<hr/>\n\n<ul>\n<li> <code>page</code>: page number </li>\n<li> <code>page_size</code>: size of the page </li>\n<li> <code>sort_key</code>: order key of the resource </li>\n<li> <code>sort_order</code>: order of the resource , default: null, collection: (\"asc\",\"desc\") </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr/>\n<h3>'sort_key' Value Description</h3>\n<hr/>\n\n- <code>display_name</code>                   : sort by display name\n- <code>billing_address</code>                         : sort by address\n- <code>email</code> : sort by email\n- <code>phone</code>            : sort by phone number\n- <code>balance_customer</code>                          : sort by balance",
